ri"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri"/><a:sym typeface="Calibri"/></a:rPr><a:t>Overview of Amino Acid Catabolism</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:cxnSp><p:nvCxnSpPr><p:cNvPr id="156" name="Google Shape;156;p22"/><p:cNvCxnSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvCxnSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="457200" y="762000"/><a:ext cx="8229600" cy="0"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="straightConnector1"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln cap="flat" cmpd="thinThick" w="57150"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="2FB0DC"/></a:solidFill><a:prstDash val="solid"/><a:miter lim="800000"/><a:headEnd len="med" w="med" type="none"/><a:tailEnd len="med" w="med" type="none"/></a:ln></p:spPr></p:cxnSp><p:pic><p:nvPicPr><p:cNvPr descr="An overview of amino acid catabolism in mammals. At the top is intracellular protein, which has reversible arrows pointing to amino acids. To the left of amino acids is dietary protein, which has an arrow pointing right to amino acids. Below amino acids are two arrows, one going left and one going right. The arrow pointing left is NH4+, which has an arrow pointing down and left to carbamoyl phosphate. Above this, an arrow jets off this arrow to the left to biosynthesis of amino acids, nucleotides, and biological amines. The arrow that aims right points to carbon skeletons. Below this is an arrow pointing down to alpha-keto acids. Below carbamoyl phosphate and alpha-keto acids are three circles made up of arrows. The first circle is the urea cycle. Carbamoyl phosphate points into the circle, and continues around, until at the bottom it points to urea (nitrogen excretion product). To the right of this circle is aspartate-arginino-succinate shunt of citric acid cycle. To the right of this circle is the citric acid cycle. Alpha-keto acids points into it, and at the ride side of the circle, an arrow jets off to CO2 [plus] H2O [plus] ATP. At the bottom of the circle, another arrow jets off, pointing to oxaloacetate, which points down to glucose (synthesized in gluconeogenesis). " id="157" name="Google Shape;157;p22"/><p:cNvPicPr preferRelativeResize="0"/><p:nvPr/></p:nvPicPr><p:blipFill rotWithShape="1"><a:blip r:embed="rId3"><a:alphaModFix/></a:blip><a:srcRect b="0" l="0" r="0" t="0"/><a:stretch/></p:blipFill><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="2084387" y="955675"/><a:ext cx="5307012" cy="5740400"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln><a:noFill/></a:ln></p:spPr></p:pic></p:spTree></p:cSld><p:clrMapOvr><a:masterClrMapping/></p:clrMapOvr></p:sld>